## 2. Streaming SSE

POST /api/ai/chat → text/event-stream
Events: data: {"chunk": "4 mots"} → data: {"done": true, "model": "..."}

---

## 3. Animations

- chunkIn: opacity 0→1, translateY 4px→0 (150ms)
- cursorBlink: barre clignotante (800ms)
- settle: scale 1.01→1 (200ms)
- shimmer: ligne de chargement (1.5s)
- pulseGlow: glow bouton pendant streaming

